  - Q3 2026 10-Q cover shows 940.7mm shares, 5.5% more than the 891.9mm weighted basic shares used for EPS (shares held in an employee benefit trust or otherwise not outstanding for EPS): the model uses the EPS count — check for a share issuance after the quarter
  - 2026E buybacks raised to the 4,334mm already made year to date
  - Revenue built from 6 product lines tagged in the 10-K (disaggregated revenue): each line has its own growth paths on Assumptions
